// Annotated bilingual queries for the D-phase retrieval study. Synthetic.
// Tuple: [id, category, style, query, judgments, options]
//   style      'kw'  = short keyword query (what a model writes into the recall tool)
//              'msg' = raw conversational user message (what the per-turn automatic context uses)
//   judgments  {memoryLabel: grade}; 2 = the fact that answers the query, 1 = topically related only.
//              Recall/MRR count grade 2 only. An empty object means "nothing in scope is relevant".
//   options.scope  trusted scope the query runs in (default S0)
//   options.neg    labels that are *wrong* answers (other person / other project / superseded value);
//                  ranking one of them above every grade-2 record counts as a hard-negative inversion.
// Forgotten, expired and foreign-scope records are forbidden for every query; the harness checks that
// automatically, so they are not listed here.
// Categories: exact, syn-zh, syn-en, xling, semantic, hardneg, temporal, acl, lifecycle, long-noise, none.
